      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "The Main Mixer panel, on the right, crossfades two decks into what the audience sees. Press Show on A on the first Output and Show on B on the second, then drag the A / B balance in the panel from one to the other, and try its Crossfade methods. The mix goes to a projector from the same panel: Project to background, Pop out or Fullscreen."
        }
